<gex:description>
<gco:CharacterString>Digitizing of Common Land Units began as part of a business process reengineering initiative in 1997.  Full production of CLUs in digitizing centers began in 1999 and was largely complete by 2003.  CLU datasets were completed on a county by county basis and are subsequently aggregated into state and national level datasets.  Maintenance of CLU data is ongoing.</gco:CharacterString>
</gex:description>
